  "description": "\"As a man, I'll tell you honestly whether you make my heart flutter or die down.\"\n\nChildhood friends Lee Jin-sol and Gye Seon-woo.   \nEntering the same university, they maintain a platonic male-female friend dynamic. Jin-sol dreams of a college life breaking away from her goody-two-shoes image and tries to start a new romance, but fails repeatedly.   \nSeeking to understand why she isn't popular with men, she asks Seon-woo for advice, and to figure out the reason, the two end up sleeping together...\n\n\"Why don't you go lie down on the bed first?\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/505109155), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14591306), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000080716), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260624), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70252168), Toon365, ZzangComic, [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H050010418), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H050010418)",
